contract Names
parties we, customer

record Log
  note text
  limit HKD 100

can close by we with reason text, reason number
  requires missing > 3
  requires due < today
  requires date
  limit = HKD 5
  customer = we
  archive with nothing = 1
can archive by we with label text
  each note in (1, 2)
    requires note > 0
